 gaming environment by moving the scoreboard and gameboards anywhere in your space ensuring your setup remains consistent each time you play. More games and options are on the horizon, so break through the walls of reality and start playing Toss-a-palooza today!", "short_description": "Play classic games like Skeeball and Bowling in Mixed Reality by just using your hands with intuitive hand tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Stay Gentle Crafts", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.staygentlecrafts.com/appspolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.staygentlecrafts.com/appsterms", "publisher_name": "Stay Gentle Crafts", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.staygentlecrafts.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8901274699924707"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974755_430884359944183_8811791502844437433_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xq0y0LpNyiAQ7kNvwF23iXw&_nc_oc=AdmIuuibmSiYHdLBGYNM5CtLfk7gl7527_4swoozrt9JG4acHziXZe8kMxIljd7_Rf4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfykHB-lLJA8Ic1FEbNR1CDHnU6bU-32DCCXJAmLS_p6Tw&oe=69B14868"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Toss-a-palooza", "platform